WEBVTT

00:03:28.556 --> 00:03:30.556
don't really have many regrets about that.

00:03:30.596 --> 00:03:32.596
It's the people
who didn't take the chance.

00:03:32.596 --> 00:03:33.956
So this is boldness regrets.

00:03:33.956 --> 00:03:35.596
Boldness regrets sound like this:

00:03:35.596 --> 00:03:37.356
"If only I'd taken the chance."

00:03:37.396 --> 00:03:38.596
Third category.

00:03:38.636 --> 00:03:40.236
Moral regrets.

00:03:40.276 --> 00:03:43.276
Very interesting,
very interesting category.

00:03:43.316 --> 00:03:45.356
These are people who, again,

00:03:45.396 --> 00:03:48.156
a lot of these regrets
begin at a juncture.

00:03:48.196 --> 00:03:49.356
You're at a juncture,

00:03:49.356 --> 00:03:52.196
you can do the right thing
or you can do the wrong thing.

00:03:52.236 --> 00:03:54.436
People do the wrong thing,

00:03:54.476 --> 00:03:55.636
and they regret it.

00:03:55.676 --> 00:03:58.236
I mean, one of the ones
that really stuck with me,

00:03:58.276 --> 00:03:59.996
I'm going to try to pull it up here,

00:03:59.996 --> 00:04:02.276
is this one here, this woman.